@ticket_group.command(name="추가", description="현재 티켓 채널에 다른 멤버를 초대합니다.")
@app_commands.describe(유저="티켓에 초대할 멤버")
async def ticket_group_add(interaction: discord.Interaction, 유저: discord.Member):
    if interaction.guild is None:
        return await safe_interaction_send(interaction, "❌ 서버에서만 사용할 수 있어요.", ephemeral=True)
    c.execute(
        "SELECT 1 FROM mnb_tickets WHERE guild_id=? AND channel_id=? AND status='open'",
        (interaction.guild.id, interaction.channel.id),
    )
    if not c.fetchone():
        return await safe_interaction_send(interaction, "❌ 이 채널은 열려 있는 티켓이 아니에요.", ephemeral=True)
    await safe_interaction_defer(interaction, ephemeral=True)
    try:
        await interaction.channel.set_permissions(유저, view_channel=True, send_messages=True)
    except Exception as e:
        return await interaction.followup.send(f"❌ 실패: `{str(e)[:200]}`", ephemeral=True)
    await interaction.followup.send(f"✅ {유저.mention} 님을 티켓에 추가했어요.", ephemeral=True)
    await interaction.channel.send(f"➕ {유저.mention} 님이 티켓에 초대되었습니다.")


